# MFA Platform — Orchestration rules

Reference: **`.cursor/plans/multi-agent-execution-plan.md`**, **`AGENTS.md`**

## Current phase

**MVP** — Baseline exit complete 2026-07-10. Start MVP per execution plan.

Active sprint: `docs/plans/2026-08-mvp-execution.md`

## Phase gates

| Transition | Requirement |
|------------|-------------|
| POC → MVP | POC exit checklist in `docs/plans/2026-07-05-phased-build-plan.md` |
| MVP → Production | MVP exit checklist + explicit user request for Production scope |

## Agent selection

| Layer | Agent |
|-------|-------|
| Phase kickoff / parallel tracks | `mfa-platform-orchestrator` |
| API / workers | `mfa-backend-engineer` |
| Crawler | `mfa-crawler-engineer` |
| ML / eval | `mfa-ml-engineer` |
| RAG | `mfa-rag-engineer` |
| UI | `mfa-review-ui-engineer` |
| Infra / AWS | `mfa-infra-engineer` |
| ADRs / scope | `mfa-architect` |
| Security gate (MVP AI+) | `mfa-security-reviewer` |

## Parallel work

- **Safe:** `infra/` + `crawler/` + `ml/` in separate branches
- **Sequential:** API contract before UI; infra SQS before queue migration; citation validator before chat API

## Branch naming

`cursor/<phase>-<task-id>-<summary>` → PR into `develop`

## Status updates

On task completion, update status in `docs/plans/2026-07-05-phased-build-plan.md`.
